<tr><td>Inspection requests</td><td>(956) 681-1328</td></tr>
<tr><td>Re-roofing</td><td>Generally requires a building permit; confirm the scope with the department</td></tr>
<tr><td>Residential repair and remodel</td><td>The residential permit application includes repair/remodeling options and roof types (wood shingle, composition, metal, built-up, cement)</td></tr>
